OL,3,GNEWSAPath to Scotland's first Center
OL,4,AParcs secures funding support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed #12m path linking two towns
OL,7,Fin the Borders to Scotland's first
OL,8,FCenter Parcs has secured funding
OL,9,Fsupport.
OL,11,FThe aim is to cut car journeys and
OL,12,Fincrease active travel, with daily
OL,13,Fcommuting trips between Hawick and
OL,14,FSelkirk expected to more than double
OL,15,Fwhen the holiday village opens in 2029.
OL,17,FIt is one of a range or projects in the
OL,18,Fregion to have gained nearly #3.5m of
OL,19,FTransport Scotland funding.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
