OL,3,GNEWSAPath to Scotland's first Center
OL,4,AParcs secures funding support
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny Linehan, executive member for
OL,7,Ftransport on Scottish Borders Council,
OL,8,Fsaid it was a "significant" award which
OL,9,Fcould help make active travel a
OL,10,F"realistic and attractive choice for
OL,11,Fmore people".
